          "start": 260
        },
        "quote": "(b) This chapter refers to the City of Topeka stormwater BMP design policy handbook (handbook) and the City of Topeka design criteria and drafting standards (standards). The referenced handbook and standards shall be considered an integral part of this chapter without separate adoption. Where provisions of this chapter conflict with the handbook or standards, this chapter shall control. Permissive and advisory provisions in the handbook and standards shall not be construed as mandatory.",
